{"name":"Deer hunting season dates by state, 2026–27: archery, firearm and muzzleloader seasons from state wildlife agencies","description":"The 2026–27 deer season dates for nine US states — Indiana, Minnesota, Missouri, New York, Ohio, Pennsylvania, Tennessee, Texas and Wisconsin — one record per state per season type (archery, firearm/gun, muzzleloader, youth), taken from the state wildlife agency's own published season table. Dates change every year, many states set them by formula ('Saturday before Thanksgiving'), and unit-level exceptions are common — so the unaided answer is usually last year's date or a content-mill guess. Each record carries the statewide date range as printed and a flag when the agency's page shows unit/zone variation. Answers 'when does gun deer season open in Wisconsin in 2026?', 'is archery season still open in Pennsylvania in December?', and 'do Wisconsin and Minnesota firearm seasons overlap?'","url":"https://referencesource.org/deer-season-dates-by-state/","licence":"State government publications; season dates are facts. We take the dates plus short attributed quotes linking to the agency page. No compilation is copied — each record comes from its own state's page.","last_verified":"2026-08-11","stale_after":"2027-02-27","sources":["https://www.in.gov/dnr/fish-and-wildlife/hunting-and-trapping/deer-hunting/","https://www.dnr.state.mn.us/hunting/deer/index.html","https://mdc.mo.gov/hunting-trapping/species/deer","https://dec.ny.gov/news/press-releases/2026/10/dec-announces-2026-big-game-hunting-seasons-in-october","https://dam.assets.ohio.gov/image/upload/ohiodnr.gov/documents/wildlife/news/2026-27_Hunting_Seasons.pdf","https://www.pgc.pa.gov/HuntTrap/Law/Pages/SeasonsandBagLimits.aspx","https://www.tn.gov/twra/hunting/big-game/deer.html","https://tpwd.texas.gov/regulations/outdoor-annual/regs/animals/white-tailed-deer","https://tpwd.texas.gov/regulations/outdoor-annual/regs/animals/mule-deer","https://dnr.wisconsin.gov/topic/hunt/dat